                = succeed "." do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quantaloid"} quantaloid
                %em arbitrary
                sums: it is large even if the original quantaloid is small, and its existence depends on the precise definition we choose of Cauchy completion. See
                %a{:href => "#J1989"} Johnson
                for more details.
            %li
